    m_Localized: Nails
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 572760146087936
    m_Localized: "Mom is packing lunch for her son:\r\n\u2014 I put bread, sausage,
      and nails in your backpack.\r\n\u2014 Mom, why??\r\n\u2014 Well, you take the
      bread, put sausage on it, and eat.\r\n\u2014 And the nails?\r\n\u2014 There
      they are!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 574682726961152
    m_Localized: I believed my parents in vain when they said, 'When you turn 18,
      you can become whatever you want.' I'm already 25, and I'm still not Batman.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
